></span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"><!--StartFragment--><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">짧은 면접과정에서 자신의 학습 경험 및 전공 기술 능력을 효과적으로 표현하는 경험 제공</span></font></span></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">- 자신의 일에 대한 체계적 관리 능력 및 효과적 전달 능력 배양 유도</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">2. 참가자격</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;① 2009년 현재 금오공과대학교 3, 4학년 재학생&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;② 1인 1개의 포트폴리오 제출</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;③ 공학교육인증 프로그램 및 학부(과)에 따른 신청작 제한 없음</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">3. 경진대회 일정</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"321\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">주요내용</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"242\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">경진대회일정</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"321\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">학생 포트폴리오 경진대회 참가 신청서 제출</font></spa