e=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">http://kumoh.ac.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;④ 수상자 의무사항 : 수상자는 필요시 국내 타 기관이나 학회에서 주최하는 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생 포트폴리오 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">경진대회에 참가할 자격이 자동 부여됨.</font></span></font></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><strong>6. 평가방법</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 평가단 구성</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 위원장 : 공학교육혁신센터장</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 위&nbsp; 원 : 공학교육혁신센터운영위원 교수, 공학교육인증 프로그램 PD교수, </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\"></span></font><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">공학교육혁신센터자문위원, 지방자치단체 공학교육혁신센터지원사업 담당자</span></font></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 평가기준 : 창작성, 내용의 체계성, 학습성과달성도, 표현성 등</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 평가등급 : 대상 1명, 금상 1명, 은상 3명, 동상 5명, 장려상 5명 총 15명</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><strong>7.&nbsp; 학생 포트폴리오 구성 내용(예시) </strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">① </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">포트폴리오는 취업 인터뷰 또는 대학원 진학 등의 목적에 맞게 자유로운 형태로 작성</font></span></font></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 포트폴리오 작성자 프로필 : </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- '나를 알리기 위한 나만의 전략’ 을 포함하여 자신을 소개하는 내용</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 이력서 (한글/ 영문), 자기소개서,&nbsp; 공인기관의 영어 성적, 자격증, 수상경력,</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;연수경력 및 인턴쉽경력</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 기술 부분 작성:</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"2\">학생 본인이 수행한 학습 및 특정기술내용, 이수과목 기록, 학습성과 관리, 학습결과물</font> </span></font></font></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;국내외 발표 논문, 졸업논문, 동아리 봉사활동 기록</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 공학인증 교육요소 관리</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학업계획서, 강의계획서, 강의내용 요약서 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학년/학기별 이수 과목 목록 및 성적표 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 이수 현황, 공학교육인증 이수체계도, </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 프로그램 학습성과 관리(성취도표), </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교육목표 달성도, 이수과목 과제물 및 발표</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생상담일지(정기, 수시, 수강지도 상담)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 설계교과목 내용요약</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 개인정보 및 활동기록(학회 발표 자료, 동아리 활동 보고서, </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 창의 설계 경진대회 참가 내용</font></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><strong>8.&nbsp; 서류 제출처</strong></font></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><span style=